                    "speaker": "Ravi",
                    "text": "You should be careful about who you reveal yourself to. There's been some 'activity' lately… The buildings are… unstable. Our daughter…"
                },
                {
                    "speaker": "Nima",
                    "text": "Ravi, take your own advice."
